  "reason": "surplus -> excess at L2 (age ~9): both surplus and excess are economics/academic vocabulary (around Year 6-7) that a 9-year-old does not know, and every distractor (revenue, premium, export, investment) is adult finance vocabulary too. It is too obscure for the level."
 },
